WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.074
Poor Greta was still sobbing.

2
00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:14.786
Ben thought Winnie might start to cry too as she gazed around the gym in dismay.

3
00:00:14.787 --> 00:00:17.373
"Who did this?" Winnie murmured.

4
00:00:17.374 --> 00:00:20.405
"Why would somebody spill our paint?"

5
00:00:20.406 --> 00:00:26.756
Greta sniffed. "I bet it was the same monster who drew the mustache on Mr. Freaky's poster.

6
00:00:26.757 --> 00:00:30.533
That was funny, but this is mean!"

7
00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:33.940
"It is mean," Ben thought.

8
00:00:33.941 --> 00:00:40.998
He remembered that Mog had been with the Doppel Gang when they decorated Mr. Freaky's poster with a mustache.

9
00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:46.091
Ben hoped Mog wasn't involved in this prank.

10
00:00:46.092 --> 00:00:52.196
"You know what?" Winnie took a deep breath.

11
00:00:52.197 --> 00:00:53.915
"It doesn't matter who did it.

12
00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:57.961
We have to get the mess cleaned up so we can start painting."

13
00:00:57.962 --> 00:01:01.147
"Right," a witch named Samantha chimed in.

14
00:01:01.148 --> 00:01:03.177
"Let's get to work."

15
00:01:03.178 --> 00:01:05.826
Nodding, Greta wiped her nose.

16
00:01:05.827 --> 00:01:10.260
"I'll see if Mr. Bog can help us."

17
00:01:10.261 --> 00:01:13.325
She hurried off to get the school janitor.

18
00:01:13.326 --> 00:01:15.660
Winnie turned to Waldo.

19
00:01:15.661 --> 00:01:21.078
"Our painting has to be ready for Leonardo da Creepy's visit on Friday night.

20
00:01:21.079 --> 00:01:24.630
Do you think you can make more paints for us tonight?"

21
00:01:24.631 --> 00:01:29.473
"Sure." Waldo was wiping some paint drops from his glasses.

22
00:01:29.474 --> 00:01:33.921
"It should be okay. I mean, as long as my magic spell works again."

23
00:01:33.922 --> 00:01:36.279
"Uh-oh," Ben thought.

24
00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.408
Waldo's spells rarely worked the way they were supposed to.

25
00:01:41.409 --> 00:01:50.350
A few minutes later, Mr. Bog arrived with his cart, and everyone began cleaning.

26
00:01:50.351 --> 00:01:55.596
As Ben mopped the floor, he looked around for clues.

27
00:01:55.597 --> 00:01:59.560
On the far side of the gym, he spotted something.

28
00:01:59.561 --> 00:02:05.995
Tiny droplets of paint were tracked across the floor.

29
00:02:05.996 --> 00:02:10.130
Ben put down the mop and followed the trail.

30
00:02:10.131 --> 00:02:16.735
It led out a rear door of the gym and into the boys' locker room.

31
00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:24.675
Near the row of sinks, the paint trail stopped.

32
00:02:24.676 --> 00:02:27.205
"Huh," Ben murmured.

33
00:02:27.206 --> 00:02:32.528
"Maybe the vandal stopped here to clean paint off himself."

34
00:02:32.529 --> 00:02:38.871
Ben floated around the locker room, looking for more clues. Nothing.

35
00:02:38.872 --> 00:02:45.819
Back in the hallway, he floated around, searching for signs of anything unusual.

36
00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.904
As he passed the cafeteria, he halted.

37
00:02:48.905 --> 00:02:54.969
There was something unusual—the three doppelgangers were inside with buckets and sponges.

38
00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:57.974
They were wiping down the tables.

39
00:02:57.975 --> 00:03:00.888
"What are you guys doing?" Ben called.

40
00:03:00.889 --> 00:03:05.724
Larry moaned. "We got detention!"

41
00:03:05.725 --> 00:03:10.166
The office ogre stood nearby, her arms folded.

42
00:03:10.167 --> 00:03:14.870
"They drew a mustache on Mr. Freaky's poster," she snapped. "I

43
00:03:14.871 --> 00:03:20.205
don't care what Ms. Van Ghoul says—that is not art. It

44
00:03:20.206 --> 00:03:24.047
is vandalism, pure and simple!" "How

45
00:03:24.048 --> 00:03:28.418
much longer do we have to clean?" Carly complained. "You'll

46
00:03:28.419 --> 00:03:31.597
clean until I tell you it's time to stop. Poor

47
00:03:31.598 --> 00:03:36.064
Mr. Bog had to help with some emergency cleanup in the gym. I

48
00:03:36.065 --> 00:03:40.869
may send you down there to help him after you've finished this!" Ben

49
00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:47.729
noticed that none of the doppelgangers reacted to the office ogre's mention of the gym emergency. "Hmm,"

50
00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:56.919
he thought. "Maybe they didn't spill the paint. Now, where's Mog?" A

51
00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:02.851
few minutes later, Ben found his friend in the art room. Several

52
00:04:02.852 --> 00:04:10.212
photos were spread out in front of Mog—they were pictures of Monster Academy teachers. Ben

53
00:04:10.213 --> 00:04:17.633
told Mog about the spilled paint, watching his face carefully. "Wow."

54
00:04:17.634 --> 00:04:24.833
Mog looked upset. "That's terrible. Can I help?" "I

55
00:04:24.834 --> 00:04:30.260
think Winnie and her friends can handle the mess," Ben replied carefully. "But

56
00:04:30.261 --> 00:04:33.971
do you have any idea who might have done it?" "Nope."

57
00:04:33.972 --> 00:04:36.946
Mog shook his head. "I've

58
00:04:36.947 --> 00:04:42.014
been in here since classes ended, working on an art project." He

59
00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:44.942
held up a photo of the gym teacher. He'd

60
00:04:44.943 --> 00:04:49.408
drawn a mustache and beard on the teacher's face. "I

61
00:04:49.409 --> 00:04:54.484
call it Gwarg With Goatee ," Mog said proudly.

62
00:04:54.485 --> 00:05:01.000
He showed Ben several other pictures with mustaches and beards drawn on them.

63
00:05:01.001 --> 00:05:02.579
"What do you think?"

64
00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:07.116
Ben shook his head. "Sorry, Mog, but I don't call that art."

65
00:05:07.117 --> 00:05:09.662
"What do you mean?" Mog said.

66
00:05:09.663 --> 00:05:12.581
"Winnie said I needed inspiration.

67
00:05:12.582 --> 00:05:16.272
I got inspired—by the Doppel Gang's art."

68
00:05:16.273 --> 00:05:18.858
"It's not really art," Ben repeated.

69
00:05:18.859 --> 00:05:24.449
"The Doppel Gang was just making trouble when they drew that mustache on Mr. Freaky."

70
00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:29.910
"Ms. Van Ghoul said it was art!" Mog said indignantly.

71
00:05:29.911 --> 00:05:36.282
"I think she just wanted to calm down Mr. Freaky, so he wouldn't ruin Art Week before it began."

72
00:05:36.283 --> 00:05:39.638
"Well, I like these photos," Mog insisted.

73
00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:43.459
"I'm going to give them to Ms. Van Ghoul to display for Art Week.

74
00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:49.149
If she doesn't like them, she doesn't have to use them."

75
00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:56.838
Ben sighed and then floated out of the classroom and back to the gym.

76
00:05:56.839 --> 00:06:00.589
He still had no idea who'd tampered with the magic paints.

77
00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.315
But he was a reporter.

78
00:06:02.316 --> 00:06:07.500
So he knew how to keep his eyes and ears open for clues.

